{
  "title": "IsardVDI User Experience",
  "uid": "isard-user-experience",
  "schemaVersion": 37,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "tags": [
    "isardvdi",
    "ux",
    "faro"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-12h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "hypervisor",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(isardvdi_domain_balloon_rss, hypervisor)",
          "refId": "hyp"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(isardvdi_domain_balloon_rss, hypervisor)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**User experience, measured without touching any desktop.** Everything comes from data the platform already collects: users' browsers (Faro, requires `FARO_ENABLED`), service logs (Loki) and the libvirt statistics of each desktop (VictoriaMetrics). Always percentiles: **p50** is the typical user, **p90** the worst one in ten.\n\nRows: **Portal** (page load) · **Actions** (time of each click, seen from the browser) · **Start** (from the click to a running desktop) · **Viewers** · **Inside the desktop** (CPU, disk and memory as the guest feels them) · **Hosts**. The last row lists what is **not** visible yet."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Portal: page load in the browser (Faro web-vitals, p75)",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TTFB: time to first byte",
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "P8E80F9AEF21F6940"
      },
      "description": "p75 of time_to_first_byte measured in each user's browser. Includes the client network.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "sortBy": "Max",
          "sortDesc": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.75, {source=\"faro\"} |= \"type=web-vitals\" | logfmt | time_to_first_byte!=\"\" | unwrap time_to_first_byte [5m]) by (app)",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "P8E80F9AEF21F6940"
          },
          "refId": "A"
